# --- Real data: never commit ----------------------------------------
# This repo is PUBLIC. Everything in this section contains the group's
# actual personal data — real names, home addresses, and exact GPS
# coordinates — so none of it belongs on GitHub.
asados.db
backups/
# The historical spreadsheet the existing asados were imported from
# (see CHANGELOG 1.0.0). Same personal data as asados.db, just in a
# different file format — it is deliberately kept LOCALLY as the
# provenance record of that import, and deliberately not tracked.
# The glob covers the later corrected revisions too ("Base Histórica
# v2.csv", ...) — v2 was sitting untracked but UN-ignored for a while,
# exactly the near-miss the 1.0.0 audit caught with v1. No leading
# whitespace on these lines, ever: it silently breaks the match.
Base Histórica*.csv

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------
# Signs the session cookies. Committing this would let anyone forge a
# login session for the live site.
secret_key.txt
# Guards /export/base-asados.csv (the Looker Studio / Google Sheets
# feed) — the token that lets that ONE route skip the login page.
# Committing it would let anyone with the repo pull the group's real
# names/addresses/points straight off the live site, no login needed.
export_token.txt

# --- Python / editor noise -------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
env/
.vscode/
